  "goodToKnow": "Der Macher (die Macherin) is a doer or go-getter, someone who gets things done: Er gilt als Macher. Politicians like to present themselves as Macher rather than Zauderer (ditherers). Die Macher can also be the creators of a film, show or product. In compounds: der Uhrmacher (watchmaker), der Spielmacher (playmaker), der Liedermacher (singer-songwriter). Die Machenschaften are schemes. Plural: die Macher."
